Package: strtools
Type: Package
Title: Tools for the Analysis of STR Fingerprinting Data
Version: 1.0.1
Date: 2026-11-15
Authors@R: person("Pierre", "Bady", email = "badozor@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions used to encode and compare short tandem repeat (STR)
    DNA fingerprints of cell lines, as described in Bady et al. (2012)
    <doi:10.1093/neuonc/nos072>. STR profiles are recoded as allele
    presence/absence tables ('genocell' objects), compared with the
    Masters (EV) similarity index, summarised by marker (homozygosity,
    heterozygosity) and studied by simulation of similarity scores.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0), ade4
Suggests: boot
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
